99 1702 2643 1913 Q 2387 2125 1920 2125 Q 1453 2125 1197 1913 Q 941 1702 941 1325 L 941 1190 Q 941 813 1197 601 Q 1453 390 1920 390 z\nM 1920 2573 Q 2336 2573 2557 2755 Q 2778 2938 2778 3277 L 2778 3373 Q 2778 3712 2557 3894 Q 2336 4077 1920 4077 Q 1504 4077 1283 3894 Q 1062 3712 1062 3373 L 1062 3277 Q 1062 2938 1283 2755 Q 1504 2573 1920 2573 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-42\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_10\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(211.88 51.832) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" d=\"M 3411 474 L 3411 0 L 480 0 L 480 550 L 1939 1894 Q 2253 2182 2464 2508 Q 2675 2835 2675 3155 L 2675 3232 Q 2675 3603 2470 3833 Q 2266 4064 1850 4064 Q 1440 4064 1225 3846 Q 1011 3629 922 3309 L 442 3494 Q 531 3757 700 3997 Q 870 4237 1158 4390 Q 1446 4544 1875 4544 Q 2310 4544 2617 4377 Q 2925 4211 3085 3920 Q 3245 3629 3245 3245 Q 3245 2899 3120 2611 Q 2995 2323 2774 2067 Q 2554 1811 2266 1555 L 1062 474 L 3411 474 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-40\" d=\"M 1926 -77 Q 1466 -77 1130 131 Q 794 339 611 723 Q 429 1107 429 1638 Q 429 2138 573 2573 Q 717 3008 957 3373 Q 1197 3738 1475 4016 Q 1754 4294 2022 4467 L 2714 4467 Q 2240 4122 1897 3786 Q 1555 3450 1331 3059 Q 1107 2669 986 2150 L 1018 2138 Q 1126 2323 1270 2467 Q 1414 2611 1619 2694 Q 1824 2778 2093 2778 Q 2477 2778 2774 2611 Q 3072 2445 3241 2134 Q 3411 1824 3411 1402 Q 3411 966 3225 630 Q 3040 294 2707 108 Q 2374 -77 1926 -77 z\nM 1920 390 Q 2214 390 2422 499 Q 2630 608 2742 819 Q 2854 1030 2854 1331 L 2854 1382 Q 2854 1683 2742 1894 Q 2630 2106 2422 2214 Q 2214 2323 1920 2323 Q 1626 2323 1418 2214 Q 1210 2106 1098 1894 Q 986 1683 986 1382 L 986 1331 Q 986 1030 1098 819 Q 1210 608 1418 499 Q 1626 390 1920 390 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-40\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_11\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(324.204675 28.893333) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-40\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p6bf9a96d73\"><rect x=\"46.1\" y=\"11.528\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"127.512\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Patients a day","note":null},"answer":"<p>Rooms: 10 × 9 hours × 2 an hour = <b>180</b>. Doctors: 6 × 7 hours × 3 an hour = <b>126</b>.</p> <p>Demand is 160 a day. <b>Doctors are the bottleneck</b>; rooms already have spare capacity. Four more rooms would add nothing.</p>"},{"q":"How could Westmoor raise doctor capacity without hiring doctors?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>Give history-taking and measurements to <b>intake nurses</b> before the doctor comes in: if doctor time falls from 20 to 15 minutes, capacity rises to 6 × 7 × 4 = <b>168</b>, above demand.</p> <p>Cost: two nurses at about $70k = $140k a year, against $600k for rooms that wouldn't help. Rooms still fit: 168 patients need 84 room-hours, against 90 available.</p>"},{"q":"What else could help?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Video appointments for follow-ups, which need no room</li><li>Reminders to cut no-shows, so doctor time isn't wasted</li><li>Longer doctor sessions on the busiest days</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Don't build the rooms: doctors, not rooms, limit Westmoor to about 126 patients a day against 160 requests, and the rooms can already handle 180. Hire two intake nurses to take histories and measurements, cutting doctor time to 15 minutes and lifting capacity to about 168 a day for about $140k a year. Risk: doctors must trust the nurses' notes. Next step: trial with two doctors for a month and measure appointment length.","great":["Computes capacity for both rooms and doctors","Identifies the real constraint","Rejects a fix aimed at the wrong constraint","Finds a cheaper fix that shifts work off the bottleneck"],"id":79,"slug":"westmoor-clinic"}